{"about_the_game":"&quot;Who will face the half-remembered horrors of their past?&quot;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Hero Origin Pack includes a fully functional skin of each hero's former self, first glimpsed in their Shine of Remembrance sequences.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTransform your heroes into their past forms as you race towards the looming mountain to face your failures!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis pack contains the Origin hero skin for each hero in Darkest Dungeon II, including DLC Characters. In order to access DLC character skins, you will need to own the associated DLC.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOnce you've downloaded the pack, you'll need to complete each hero's Shrines to unlock their origin skin in the Cosmetics tab.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3715610?t=1750267522","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715610/8bb35e913209a4426a93a70c0d817f637a9f141a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750267522","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715610/63bb48f86b4313743ea332b6bd9da780134a1726/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750267522","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715610/63bb48f86b4313743ea332b6bd9da780134a1726/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750267522","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"&quot;Who will face the half-remembered horrors of their past?&quot;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Hero Origin Pack includes a fully functional skin of each hero's former self, first glimpsed in their Shine of Remembrance sequences.<br />\r\n<br />